### ① Admin 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "demo123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data);
%}


### ② 触发知识库 1 的评估
# version 用于标识本次评估配置，方便后续对比
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/eval/1/run?version=v1_hybrid_reranker
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


### ③ 查看知识库 1 的历史评估记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/eval/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}